    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-πέμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send round</i> from one place to another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[νέας] π. ἔξωθεν Σκιάθου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.7
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο τέλη τῶν ἱππέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.86
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ νῆες . . αἱ ἐς τὸν λιμένα
					περιπεμφθεῖσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>send round</i> to a number of places, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ περιπεμφθέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.48
				</span></i>
			.</div>
